  "title": [
    "[The Graveyard Temporalis]"
  ],
  "description": [
    "A stonework gazebo, with stately pillars and a filigreed wrought iron dome, lurks off to the north of the path, accompanied by a couple of towering oaks.  The long moss-laden branches offer a certain amount of coverage to the structure, which is otherwise open to the sky, but the tangle of dark green, crimson-veined vines laced into its iron work offers far more.  Gravestones set at awkward angles, half-sunk into the soft ground, encircle the gazebo."
  ],
